      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "BROADCAST & SUPERNATURAL WAIVER\nThe Grand Void Playhouse\n\n1. DUTIES:\n\nStreamer
    agrees to host an uninterrupted live broadcast. \nKeep audible crying to a minimum
    and continue reading paid donations, even during active demonic manifestations.\n\n2.
    ASSUMPTION OF RISK:\n\nThe Theater is not liable for possession, missing limbs,
    mimic clones, cursed chat moderators, or ectoplasm inside your streaming gear.
    Do not interact with the audience in Balcony B.\n\n3. PAYOUT:\n\n15% of net superchats
    (minus cleaning fees for blood/slime). Surviving until 6:00 AM earns one (1)
    free lobby pretzel.\n\nI accept all risks, supernatural or otherwise:"
